<title>UK: Alliance expects sale of 27 pct of shares.</title>
<headline>Alliance expects sale of 27 pct of shares.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>British building society Alliance &amp; Leicester said on Wednesday it expected the total number of free shares that members will sell at auctions would be 26.9 percent.</p>
</text>
